profile r along z 0 0 0 20 0 0 20 10 0 0 10 0
extrude blk from 0 to 5 r
profile q along z 5 2 0 15 2 0 15 8 0 5 8 0
extrude top from 5 to 7 q
union u blk top
round 0.5 blk.end top
round 0.4 convex
